=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Behsa Alehgo} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} (J-7).
* Enter {z:Celennia Memorial Library} for a cutscene.
* Go to {z:Yorcia Weald} and check the **Suspicious Place** in the large grove of Numbing Blossoms on the south side of (I-8) for a cutscene.
** Either head northwest from Bivouac #2 and then zigzag north, or zigzag south from Bivouac #1.
* Click the **Suspicious Place** again to spawn **{m:Jovial Ahriman}**.
** Mob has about 70,000 HP.
** Be wary of the Numbing Blossoms nearby as they will paralyze you.
** Uses standard {p:Ahriman|Category:Ahriman} moves, along with Cruel Joke (20 tic), at 25% or so.
** Casts Kaustra, Dread Spikes, Frazzle 3, Endark.
* After defeating {m:Jovial Ahriman}, check the **Suspicious Place** a third time for a cutscene.
* Head to the **Pool of Clarity** Ergon Locus at (G-6) (North west of Bivouac #1) and click on the **Pellucid Afflusion** for a final cutscene and your reward.

